      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I have a clear picture of the test. I'll improve understandability by:\n1. Removing all unused imports\n2. Using `@Nested` classes with descriptive names to group related assertions by `IOCase` mode\n3. Splitting assertions into focused test methods with meaningful namesNow let me compile-check the generated test.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored test groups assertions into three `@Nested` classes (`WhenSensitive`, `WhenInsensitive`, `WhenSystem`), each with focused single-purpose test methods that clearly communicate what behavior is being verified."
